    {
      "id": "step-009",
      "title": "第一次Import在确认Dialog取消，树身份、顺序与Core revision必须保持不变。 / Cancel the first Import preview; tree identity, ordering, and Core revision must remain unchanged.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "capture": "renderer",
      "image": "step-009.png",
      "rawImage": "step-009.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-011",
      "title": "再次Import并确认，验证追加位置、全新ID、enabled沿用、目录层级与原子持久化。 / Import again and confirm, proving append order, fresh IDs, preserved enabled state, hierarchy, and atomic persistence.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "capture": "renderer",
      "image": "step-011.png",
      "rawImage": "step-011.png"
    },
    {
      "id": "step-013",
      "title": "Reload Renderer后必须从Core恢复同一批身份；随后重复导入仍只能追加全新节点。 / Reload Renderer to restore the same identities from Core, then repeat Import and require another fresh append.",
      "language": "en",
      "theme": "light",
      "window": "app",
      "capture": "renderer",
      "image": "step-013.png",
      "rawImage": "step-013.png"
    }
